			"notes": "### 新增方块：存钱罐\n可使用6个金锭合成，放置后手持钱币右键即可存入，存入后的钱币数量将不会显示，打破存钱罐后会以掉落物的形式返还。\n### New block: piggy bank\nIt can be synthesized with 6 gold ingots. After placing the piggy bank, you can deposit it by holding the coin right-click, and the number of coins after depositing will not be displayed, and it will be returned in the form of a drop after breaking the piggy bank.\n<img width=\"664\" height=\"282\" alt=\"8eabddd221a88e4499d8117a1529da04\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18acd799-ea89-417b-9550-3d42f42a2046\" />"
